{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons &amp; Dimensions is a focused, solo Action-Adventure where you conquer massive, unique fantasy worlds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a64e882e97c13f2b92712be2f8e28857.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a64e882e97c13f2b92712be2f8e28857.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a64e882e97c13f2b92712be2f8e28857.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/58d1d43a811792695db43caea29dde71.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/58d1d43a811792695db43caea29dde71.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/58d1d43a811792695db43caea29dde71.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an engaging storyline as you explore. Each Dimension holds a specific, self-contained narrative you must thoroughly explore, piece together its story, and overcome its challenges to unlock the path to the next dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and prepare for battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/de1e06700042ab4933f539031ac89da9.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/de1e06700042ab4933f539031ac89da9.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/de1e06700042ab4933f539031ac89da9.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master casual Souls-like combat, accessible, but demanding in its preparation. Explore the world, gather items, and gain power to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find,\u00a0Recruit &amp; Risk your Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/f26e6299b959c823403756d96fbbd932.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/f26e6299b959c823403756d96fbbd932.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/f26e6299b959c823403756d96fbbd932.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find &amp; Collect dozens of unique heroes, each with specific strengths and weaknesses. You must find and complete their story to unlock them. If a hero dies, they are lost forever. Choose wisely who you risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>See you Dimensionalists !</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2813980?t=1771704428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771704428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771704428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771704428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons &amp; Dimensions is a focused, solo Action-Adventure where you conquer massive, unique fantasy worlds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a64e882e97c13f2b92712be2f8e28857.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a64e882e97c13f2b92712be2f8e28857.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a64e882e97c13f2b92712be2f8e28857.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/58d1d43a811792695db43caea29dde71.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/58d1d43a811792695db43caea29dde71.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/58d1d43a811792695db43caea29dde71.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an engaging storyline as you explore. Each Dimension holds a specific, self-contained narrative you must thoroughly explore, piece together its story, and overcome its challenges to unlock the path to the next dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and prepare for battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/de1e06700042ab4933f539031ac89da9.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/de1e06700042ab4933f539031ac89da9.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/de1e06700042ab4933f539031ac89da9.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master casual Souls-like combat, accessible, but demanding in its preparation. Explore the world, gather items, and gain power to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find,\u00a0Recruit &amp; Risk your Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/f26e6299b959c823403756d96fbbd932.poster.avif?t=1771704428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/f26e6299b959c823403756d96fbbd932.webm?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/f26e6299b959c823403756d96fbbd932.mp4?t=1771704428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find &amp; Collect dozens of unique heroes, each with specific strengths and weaknesses. You must find and complete their story to unlock them. If a hero dies, they are lost forever. Choose wisely who you risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>See you Dimensionalists !</strong></h2>","developers":["Dungeons & Dimensions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/header.jpg?t=1771704428","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dungeons & Dimensions","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 3200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dungeons & Dimensions"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/9420fa2f020f56b84b38f8a55fe1eab9de29eaea/ss_9420fa2f020f56b84b38f8a55fe1eab9de29eaea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771704428","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/9420fa2f020f56b84b38f8a55fe1eab9de29eaea/ss_9420fa2f020f56b84b38f8a55fe1eab9de29eaea.600x338.jpg?t=1771704428"},{"id":1,"path_full":